        "slc_ec85be6b08b79dba010fa8172a89a07c35e76471bcae9cad2b2bb3c27b7abffc"
      ],
      "text": "Core philosophy: concentrate planning in a strong model and push execution to a cheap one, with a gate (tests/checklist) re-run independently rather than self-reported as the trust contract."
    },
