        "slc_cedb34880f8cf73d39e01930098fa8fd8299362deb17e600bd3fac61b0a3084f"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin bundles six skills: thrifty and thrifty-dispatch (orchestrators), thrifty-plan (Sonnet), thrifty-brief (Sonnet, split tier), thrifty-execute (Haiku), and thrifty-check (Sonnet), with orchestrators running in-session."
    },
