      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3c1ee75439a683d7a0cf17cf08398a06db3c82f144062775f801de83d7ee88b2"
      ],
      "text": "The lean dispatch flow uses dispatch.py to run bare claude -p calls that hard-pin every codegen sprint to Haiku regardless of the plan's tier, writing outputs to disk while the orchestrator reads only a tiny manifest."
    },
